dapts. However, he acknowledged that these would all require Meta to flex a q", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=1220", "end": 1277.95, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "057f4f6cf2295c90c262ec4555d4ce2a7b0f572ce6f95a39b3c65cb61c7ab99a", "start": 1220.59, "text": "Among other effects, it gives the hyperscalers the latitude they need to hike spending to match rising costs and keep the AI trade rolling. The hyperscalers say the demand is still there and it's still rising, which brings us to perhaps the", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5#t=1762", "end": 1826.03, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4311eee56c60be6a64ba32688bf060bad8cf6384a13ca5b427c64dcd72e56bd8", "start": 1762.27, "text": "You may not be interested in politics, but politics is interested in you. That's kind of how I feel about AI markets for many of us who are here around the AI daily brief. Certainly some of you are professional investors, for whom this is a", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "hint": null, "platform": "podcast", "profile": "librarian", "schema_version": 1, "selection_version": "spread-longest-v1", "slug": "what-a-30b-hedge-fund-implosion-really-means-for-ai-ee13d34d83c", "source_revision": "c346179664933cbcfeb986746f8019556125e3449c5cea733dc4b43bac4e1277", "source_type": "episode", "status": "evidenced", "summary_hint": null, "title": "What a $30B Hedge Fund Implosion Really Means for AI", "topic": "Uncategorized", "truncated": true, "truncation": {"byte_budget": true, "fields": ["hint"], "selection": true}, "url": "https://podcasters.spotify.com/pod/show/nlw/episodes/What-a-30B-Hedge-Fund-Implosion-Really-Means-for-AI-e3mqdl5", "video_id": "episode_ee13d34d83c", "yoinked_at