 "feac09a06d0320d4d52e831441c2aa7a9af6d841f12bf8b78aec7a65913f5862", "start": 3438.7, "text": "It's true that there are a lot of shorter sessions on chat, but I think the chat GPD, the product has had a ton of longevity, as long as this technology has been around, and people use it for working productivity-related things already toda", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "hint": null, "platform": "podcast", "profile": "librarian", "schema_version": 1, "selection_version": "spread-longest-v1", "slug": "codex-from-0-to-10m-users-building-chatgpt-work-akshay-nathan-openai-9ddb44f98b2", "source_revision": "bfdcd089b163bd63548e46fd4e543c0cb54c39562d78c08bc2e9e4c8cf6e33df", "source_type": "episode", "status": "evidenced", "summary_hint": null, "title": "Codex from 0 to 10M Users: Building ChatGPT Work — Akshay Nathan, OpenAI", "topic": "Uncategorized", "truncated": true, "truncation": {"byte_budget": true, "fields": ["hint"], "selection": true}, "url": "https://www.latent.space/p/chatgpt-work", "video_id": "episode_9ddb44f98b2", "yoinked_at": "2026-08-02T02:25:21Z"}
